		(descr "BAT WIRELESS BWSMA-KE-P001 edge SMA (LCSC C496550), air launch (z2labs DoE v14 coupon A0): through-milled notch 2.80 x 1.90 mm open to the board edge under the free pin, signal pad 1.55 x 0.90 mm from the notch bottom (ov 1.55, 1.2 mm soldered pin), 0.5 mm coplanar gap round the pad, leg pads 4.6 x 1.3 mm on F.Cu and B.Cu, launch via pair 0.6/0.3 beside the notch. Origin on the board edge at the pin axis, board inward +x; copper of the pours pulls back from the milled edge by the board edge clearance (0.3 mm)")
